  name: Delete Activity
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

delete {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/activities/1
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

docs {
  # Delete Activity

  Permanently deletes an activity from a trip day.

  ## URL Parameters
  - `activity_id`: The ID of the activity to delete

  ## Important Notes
  - This is a **hard delete** (permanent removal)
  - Associated bookings will also be deleted (CASCADE)
  - Cannot be undone
  - Use with caution

  ## Response
  - Status: 204 No Content (success)
  - Empty response body

  ## Access Control
  - Requires authentication
  - User must own the trip containing this activity
  - Returns 403 Forbidden if user doesn't own the trip
  - Returns 404 Not Found if activity doesn't exist

  ## Alternative: Cancel Instead
  If you want to keep the record but mark it as cancelled:
  ```
  PUT /api/v1/activities/{activity_id}
  {
    "status": "cancelled",
    "notes": "Reason for cancellation"
  }
  ```

  ## Cascade Effects
  When an activity is deleted:
  - All bookings associated with this activity are also deleted
  - Trip day remains intact
  - Other activities are not affected
}
